SUMMARY:Brookwood Casserole Delivery Day Brookshire - Aug. 29
DTSTAMP:20260816T033424Z
DTSTART:20260829T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Brookwood to Go: Casserole Delivery Days!\nSupport adults with 
	disabilities and enjoy a stress-free dinner.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for B
	rookwood Casserole Delivery Days – Brookshire Pickup!\nPre-order now and p
	ick up Saturday\, August 29 | 9:00am-4:30pm📍 The Brookwood Community – 150
	2 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX 77423 \n\nBack-to-school chaos? We’ve got dinn
	er covered. \nOur Citizens at The Brookwood Community™ know August can fee
	l like a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, and teacher meet-and-gr
	eets. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more delicious—with Brookwoo
	d Casserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen casseroles to choose
	 from✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up on your way home✅ Serv
	e 2–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support adults with disabiliti
	es who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 Your Casserole Lineup
	:\n🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, mushrooms\, basil\, a
	nd penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fiesta Chicken Enchilad
	aRoasted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso fresco\, Latin-style r
	ed sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortillas. \n🐔 King Ranch Chi
	cken – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas comfort classic made wit
	h tender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered tortillas\, and cream
	y cheesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bulk Order Discounts:\n\
	nBuy 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and save 10% with code: 10CA
	SS\n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank you for helping chan
	ge the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n🗓️ Want to kn
	ow where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of 
	Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n \n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/e
	vent/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-brookshire-aug-29/\n\nFrom Nutcracke
	r Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-b
	rookshire-aug-29/
LOCATION:The Brookwood Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX\, 77423\, Unit
	ed States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT8H
END:VEVENT
